<body style="background-color: #f9fafb;">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Data Deletion Instructions</h1>
        <p>According to the Facebook Platform rules, we have to provide <strong>User Data Deletion Callback URL</strong>
            or <strong>Data Deletion Instructions URL</strong>. If you want to delete your activities for the Dueli App,
            you can follow these instructions:</p>

        <h2>How to Remove Your Data from Dueli</h2>

        <div class="step">
            <strong>Option 1: Automated Deletion (In-App)</strong>
            1. Log into your account on Dueli.<br>
            2. Go to your <strong>Profile Settings</strong>.<br>
            3. Scroll to the bottom and click the <strong>"Delete Account"</strong> button.<br>
            4. Confirm the action. This will permanently remove your account and all associated data from our servers.
        </div>

        <div class="step">
            <strong>Option 2: Manual Request</strong>
            If you are unable to access your account, you can request data deletion by contacting us directly:<br><br>
            1. Send an email to <a href="mailto:support@maelsh.com">support@maelsh.com</a>.<br>
            2. Subject: <strong>Data Deletion Request</strong>.<br>
            3. Please include your registered email address.<br>
            4. We will process your request and delete your data within 7 business days.
        </div>

        <h2>What Data is Deleted?</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Your public profile information (Name, Avatar, Bio).</li>
            <li>Your login credentials and authentication tokens.</li>
            <li>Your competition history and comments.</li>
        </ul>

        <p style="margin-top: 40px; font-size: 0.9em; color: #666;">
            If you have any questions, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@maelsh.com">support@maelsh.com</a>.
        </p>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
